@startuml
!include publication-flow.iuml
top to bottom direction
rectangle "<b>SOURCE REVISION</b>\nCommit nguồn đã chọn" as source
rectangle "<b>JOB · verify</b>\nTest part16 / part18" as verify
rectangle "<b>JOB · build-artifact</b>\nBuildx metadata\nPhân biệt image ID / digest" as build
rectangle "<b>JOB · promote-production</b>\nEnvironment production\nOIDC: id-token write\nCLI kiểm tra candidate" as promote
rectangle "<b>QUYẾT ĐỊNH</b>\nThiếu bằng chứng: từ chối\nĐược duyệt: cập nhật\ndesired bằng manifest digest" as decision
source -down-> verify
verify -down-> build
build -right-> promote
promote -up-> decision
@enduml
